      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DEEPLY (6) finished off nicely from the second half of the field to finish 2L off the winner. She'll be better for that effort and the rise in trip looks right up her alley. Boudvillain now takes the ride and she looks to get every chance. Can get back to her best which will see her hard to hold out. AVALON LADY (5) settled last in that same race and closed nicely to be 1.3L off the winner after being off the scene for 12 months. Bourke sticks with her and she's expected to have come on from that effort. Draws better now and is sure to be in the finish again. JUSTWATCHHER (8) gets the blinkers on for the first time today after a midfield finish at Gundagai last time out. Her form prior was sound and getting back to this track can see her improve. ROSE DIAMOND (4) can feature on resumption. SON OF RUBICK (2) trialled nicely coming in and can fire a shot first-up despite the year long break.",
